[3.004, "o", "\r\n==================== 5/6 四个用例：256 点 / 1024 点 / 满幅 / 小幅，打印 SNR、最大误差、溢出次数 ====================\r\n"]
[3.024, "o", "Q15 FFT self-test: SNR vs float DFT, max error in int16 LSB\r\n\r\n--- case1 256-point (N=256, amp=2000, scaled) ---\r\nSNR=68.50 dB  max_err=40.88 (int16 LSB)  overflows=0  shifts=3\r\n\r\n--- case2 1024-point (N=1024, amp=2000, scaled) ---\r\nSNR=62.39 dB  max_err=182.26 (int16 LSB)  overflows=0  shifts=5\r\n\r\n--- case3 full-scale (N=256, amp=32767, unscaled) ---\r\nSNR=0.07 dB  max_err=3993632.49 (int16 LSB)  overflows=569  shifts=0\r\n\r\n--- case4 small-signal (N=256, amp=16, scaled) ---\r\nSNR=35.16 dB  max_err=11.97 (int16 LSB)  overflows=0  shifts=0\r\n\r\n"]
[4.005, "o", "\r\n==================== 6/6 结论：饱和蝶形 + 块浮点缩放 + 定点旋转因子表，误差可量化 ====================\r\n"]
